히 하는 이스라엘 자손의 찬양거리로다 할렐루야 !"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/148.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/149.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/147.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}